error[R0509]: circular require: loading `b.luau` leads back to this module
--> 4:18: load-time require of `b.luau`
  = note: cycle: main.luau → b.luau → c.luau → main.luau
  = note: Roblox throws `Requested module was required recursively` when the second module in the cycle loads
  = help: break the cycle: keep `local X = false and require(...)` at the top and load for real inside the function that needs it, or move the shared part into a third module
